WEBVTT

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:06.250
Man, my bad!

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:08.020
I'm late.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:09.120
Supplementary lessons again?

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.390
N-Not that!

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:16.400
Ukyo-<i>sensei</i> was just teaching me something I just couldn't get for the life of me...

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.800
That's what they call supplementary classes.

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:19.100
Wha..!

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:25.140
Duel!!

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:27.630
Yuma...

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:28.110
Huh?

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:31.210
I'm really glad I was able to meet you.

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:33.720
Wh-What's this all of a sudden?

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:36.660
When you start saying stuff like that...

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:39.620
Yuma, I'm entrusting the Numbers to you.

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:41.090
Astral...?

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:43.060
Thank you.

00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:50.270
Yuma...! Yuma!

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:50.820
Yuma!

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:52.030
Astral...

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:55.260
What are we doing here...?

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:57.590
Get your act together! We're in the middle of a Duel!

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:00.410
Number 96!

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:01.640
What's wrong?

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:03.950
Are you hallucinating now?

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:05.790
What's with Yuma...?

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:10.850
It's true that his expression looks like
 he's there in body but not spirit.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:16.470
Damn him... He's just doing whatever he wants out there...

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:18.190
But it's interesting.

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:22.730
This Chaos Field inflicts pain on those guys.

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:27.940
This should be an enjoyable sight worth seeing.

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:57.690
<i>Being best friends doesn't mean we always were</i>

00:01:57.690 --> 00:02:00.740
<i>That's pretty much true</i>

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:08.200
<i>I found you during our serious battles</i>

00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:11.750
<i>The other me inside myself</i>

00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:16.630
<i>Awakening from within the conflict</i>

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:22.970
<i>A turn for a chance! Seize it! Draw!</i>

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:26.180
<i>Duel! Dualism!</i>

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:29.060
<i>These cards are polished to fit each other</i>

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:33.690
<i>My fated opponent is my heart reflected through the mirror</i>

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:36.770
<i>And if we end up with a "tie" in the end,</i>

00:02:36.770 --> 00:02:45.240
<i>when we fall, all covered with mud, we'll praise each other</i>

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:04.240
Thanks to Heart-eartH Dragon's effect, the Sealing Swords of Flame were negated.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:06.240
Our next move is critical.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:10.670
Next move? You <i>have</i> no next move!

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:12.080
"Time of the End...! Bonds Entrusted to a Friend"

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:14.460
Coat of Arms, attack Astral directly!

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:18.510
Not good! It's a Direct Attack worth 4000 points!

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:19.380
Yuma!

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:21.510
Use Gagaga Gardna!

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:22.390
Yeah!

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:26.140
I Special Summon Gagaga Gardna from my hand!

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:30.980
This guy can be Special Summoned when I receive a Direct Attack!

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:34.560
And when I Summon a Monster on my field,

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:36.270
the Sealing Swords of Flame are destroyed!

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:38.740
Useless struggle.

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:42.110
Chaos of Arms, attack Gagaga Gardna!

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:46.200
I activate Gagaga Gardna's effect!

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:49.580
By sending a card from my hand to the Graveyard,

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:51.500
this card can negate a battle!

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:55.210
I discard Tasukeleton to the Graveyard!

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:00.670
But you still take the damage!

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:07.970
Yuma! Astral!

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:12.190
This will not change your destruction!

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:16.310
Black Storm, attack Gagaga Gardna!

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:20.280
At this moment, Black Storm's effect activates!

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:24.070
When it battles, by detaching one Chaos Overlay Unit,

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:27.490
it can make the attacking opposing Monster's Attack Power zero,

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:32.620
and add the same amount of points to Black Storm's Attack Power!

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.250
Now continue the battle!

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:40.050
I activate the effect of Tasukeleton from the Graveyard!

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:45.930
By Banishing this Monster, I negate Gagaga Gardna's destruction!

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:50.220
Then it...makes all damage to the player...zero!

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:54.980
You don't know when to give up...!
 It's unsightly, Astral!

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:58.560
We will not lose!

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:05.660
In that case, Heart-eartH Dragon attacks Gagaga Gardna!

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:21.500
You've only got 500 Life left...

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:26.550
And you still intend to fight when your body's so beat up?

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:31.220
Not... Not yet!

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:35.350
We haven't lot yet!

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:38.190
What a foolish human you are.

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:40.230
Behold this!

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:44.110
I activate Heart-eartH Dragon's effect!

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:51.120
I gain Life Points equal to the total amount of Battle Damage you took during battle this turn!

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:55.200
Now my Life becomes 7500!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:57.870
7500 Life Points?!

00:05:57.870 --> 00:05:59.580
N-No way!

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.210
How about it? Do you get it now?

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:05.550
That you can't possibly defeat me!

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:10.760
Stop talking nonsense!

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:15.180
We definitely aren't gonna lose!

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:17.850
Me and Astral...

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:19.940
...with the power of our bonds...

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:22.570
...we're gonna show you!

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.820
We're gonna bring it to-

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:29.740
Yuma!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:33.830
Yuma! Yuma!

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:41.790
Yuma... You fought well!

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:44.880
Now get some rest!

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:46.920
The heck're you talking about...?!

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:49.680
I'm...totally fine...!

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:54.510
Yuma...

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:58.390
Leave the rest to me!

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:05.440
Yuma, you have a heart that never gives up.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:11.490
And you have the will to continue walking forward
 in a straight line without looking back.

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:13.620
Toward those who believe in you.

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:15.620
Astral...

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:17.330
Yuma...

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:22.080
Whatever form we may take, we're always fighting together.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:27.210
Now, Number 96! I will be your opponent!

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.300
What nonsense!

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:32.510
What's this about a heart that doesn't give up or the will to walk forward?!

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:36.640
It's very similar to the Astral World.

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:41.640
Such a fragile world that falls apart with just the smallest amount of malicious will sneaking in!

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:46.520
And as the proof, because I stand here, not just the Astral World,

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:51.110
but the Barian and human worlds as well 
are on the verge of destruction!

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:54.950
That's right! For I am an existence equal to God!

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:58.290
You will be destroyed here and now!

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:02.790
I activate the Continuous Spell, Number Karma, from my hand!

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:06.540
At the end of your turn, this card,

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:11.550
when you don't have a Number on your field, you take 500 points of damage!

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:13.260
Say what?!

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:14.760
Now on his next turn,

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:18.010
if he can't Summon a Number, Yuma and Astral will lose.

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:22.890
I set one card face-down. Turn end!

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:27.610
<i>The Numbers Return we have set on our field</i>

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:31.280
<i>will bring a Number back from our Graveyard.</i>

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:38.240
<i>Currently in our Graveyard, we have Hope as well as Coat of Arms and Heart-eartH Dragon.</i>

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:44.710
<i>But he might be trying to use Number Karma to lure me out...</i>

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:47.960
<i>And those set cards are likely...</i>

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:50.670
Now what will you do, Astral?!

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:54.050
<i>That's right, Yuma...</i>

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:57.470
My turn! Draw!

00:08:58.010 --> 00:09:00.890
<i>We must Duel by moving straight forward
 and never looking back!</i>

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:04.520
Trap, activate! Numbers Return!

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:08.360
This card can only be activated during my turn.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:11.610
It can Special Summon one Number from my Graveyard!

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:14.820
So which Number will you choose?

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.910
Coat of Arms?

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.780
Or will it be Heart-eartH Dragon?

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:21.040
I...

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:26.170
The one I bring back is... Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:44.850
Then, thanks to the effect of Numbers Return, the Numbers in my Graveyard become Hope's Overlay Units!

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:50.230
You had two powerful Monsters in your Graveyard to revive and you chose <i>Hope</i>?!

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:51.940
Hope is...

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:55.360
...the first bond I shared with Astral!

00:09:56.700 --> 00:10:01.280
No matter how bad the Duel looks for us, he'll always be there to give us hope!

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:05.700
Hope has been fighting alongside us the longest...

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:07.620
He's our friend of hope!

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:10.790
That's while we'll believe in him!

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:15.300
Foolish! Those insignificant feelings of trust between one another

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:19.970
do nothing but produce suspicion, create hatred, and give birth to betrayal!

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:24.640
I'll erase those annoyances that bring
 nothing but trouble one by one!

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:27.810
All that's needed here is me, the God that I am!

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:32.230
That alone is an <i>ideal world</i>!

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.820
What nonsense!

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:37.860
Utter nonsense!

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:42.160
We don't need your so-called ideal world!

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:46.790
There's so many different kinds of people around us with different personalities!

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.750
Sure, we mess up and make mistakes.

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:53.090
But if we make a mistake, someone else will teach us the right way!

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:56.800
Isn't that why we keep friends close to us and comrades?!

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:59.880
You become one with your comrades...

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:03.720
Then a strength two or three times stronger is born!

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:06.390
It's fun living with everyone!

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:09.020
Don't you think it's fun?!

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:09.600
Yuma.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.940
Let's finish this together.

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:14.730
Astral...

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:17.030
Let's use ZEXAL.

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:19.200
Yeah...

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:20.780
Let's do it!

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:25.450
Let's bing it!

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:28.700
I'll take myself...

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.040
Along with me...

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:30.920
...and Overlay!

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:38.630
We'll build the Overlay Network with the two of us!

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:44.930
When the souls of two people come together
 bound by their true bonds,

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:47.220
a miracle is handed down!

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:51.390
Xyz Change!

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:52.060
ZEXAL!

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:02.910
ZEXAL, is it? But anything you try now will be too late!

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:06.580
No, the power of our bonds will definitely beat you down!

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:09.290
Let's go, Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:12.920
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:22.630
Show yourself, Chaos Number 39!

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:25.300
The Envoy who changes chaos into light!

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:27.850
Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray!

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:34.770
You fool! Trap, activate Number Death Lock!

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:37.560
It activates by choosing one Number!

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:39.690
I choose Hope Ray!

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:44.700
The targeted Monster can't attack,

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.820
and you can't use its effects!

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:51.200
And it'll be destroyed at the end of your turn!

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:56.210
And you'll take damage equal to its Attack Power!

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:58.630
2500 damage?!

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:00.250
If that happens...

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.460
This time for sure it ends!

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:04.260
Yuma!

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:05.090
Right!

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:09.350
I activate the Magic Card, Xyz Treasure!

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:15.310
This card lets me draw one card for each Xyz Monster on the field!

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:17.520
There's four Monsters on the field!

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:20.320
That means I can draw four cards!

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:24.990
The Duels of the strongest Duelists are inevitable!

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:27.610
Even the cards they draw are decided by the Duelist!

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:30.700
Shining Draw!

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:34.790
These four cards will give me victory!

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:39.080
I activate the Magic Card, Hope Heart Beat!

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:43.840
All Monsters with Hope in their names are unaffected by the opponent's card effects!

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:48.180
And all card effects activated against them are negated,

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:49.890
and those cards are destroyed!

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:54.680
Now that it's set free, I activate Hope Ray's effect!

00:13:55.140 --> 00:14:00.560
This turn, by detaching one Overlay Unit, its Attack Power increases by 500!

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:04.190
I detach all three of its Overlay Units!

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:05.860
Overlay Charge!

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:15.500
Also, the opponent's Monster loses 1000 Attack Points for each Overlay Unit detached!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.920
I select Chaos of Arms!

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:19.330
This is where it begins!

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:22.960
I Summon ZEXAL Weapon - Sleipnir Mail!

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:30.050
This card is equipped to the Hope Ray on my field,

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:35.640
and Hope Ray's Attack Power increases by its Attack Power!

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:40.650
Then I activate the Quick-Play Spell, Overtake Summon, from my hand!

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:45.860
By detaching one Overlay Unit from one of the opponent's Monsters,

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:49.110
I can Special Summon one Level Four or lower Monster from my hand!

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:57.330
Here goes! I Special Summon
 ZEXAL Weapon - Asura Blow from my hand!

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:02.210
This card can be equipped to Hope Ray on my field,

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:04.210
and raise its Attack Points!

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:11.090
Then it can attack every Monster on my opponent's field!

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:13.760
You have three Monsters on the field!

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:18.100
So it can attack three times with 6000 Attack Points!

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:21.810
Impossible! All my Monsters?!

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:24.980
Since he has 7500 Life...

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:26.690
...this'll beat the crap out of him!

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:29.950
Go, Hope Ray!

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:33.160
Start by attacking Heart-eartH Chaos Dragon!

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:37.660
Too naive! Trap, activate! Chaos Alliance!

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:45.290
It changes the Attack Power of all Chaos Numbers to that of the Monster with the highest Attack Power on the field!

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:49.760
Now all my Monsters have 2500 Attack Points!

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:52.550
Hope Sword Asura Divider!

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:08.690
Continue by attacking Chaos of Arms!

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:22.000
Now I just need to destroy Black Storm...!

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:24.460
Then it's over!

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:26.960
Did you forget?

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:30.710
When Black Storm is destroyed in battle,

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:35.010
its effect deals both players its total Attack Power as damage!

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:37.100
The same trick won't work twice!

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:41.680
Go, Hope Ray! Attack Black Storm!

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:45.190
At this moment, I activate the effect of Sleipnir Mail!

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:50.110
It makes the Attack Power of the equipped Monster the same as the opponent's Monster!

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:51.610
What did you say?!

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:53.030
He's aiming for a draw?!

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:56.200
Hope Sword Asura Divider!

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:01.370
How foolish!

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:05.290
Now you'll lose the Number on your field,

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:09.000
and when the turn ends, because of the effect of Number Karma,

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:12.550
you two will take 500 points of damage!

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:15.590
You made a grave miscalculation!

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:17.760
My turn still isn't over yet!

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:18.890
What?!

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:21.850
I activate the effect of Sleipnir Mail!

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:24.350
When the equipped Monster is destroyed,

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:28.610
we can Special Summon Aspiring Emperor - Hope from the Graveyard!

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:31.730
Come out, Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:34.990
I-Impossible...!

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:36.700
I already told you!

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:40.200
He'll always give us hope and guide us to victory!

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:43.870
For me... a <i>God</i>... to lose...!

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:47.540
Go!! Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:51.210
Direct Attack Number 96!

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:55.720
Hope Sword Ragna Kaiser Slash!!

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:14.570
They won! ZEXAL... Yuma and Astral won!

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:14.570
ZEXAL did it!

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:18.030
Did we...win?

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:20.990
Yeah. It's our victory.

00:18:22.990 --> 00:18:24.870
We did it, Astral!

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:29.330
I lost...

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:31.170
I'm a God and yet...

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:33.340
This can't be...

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:37.420
There's no way I could lose!

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:39.680
Can you stand, Yuma?

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:41.390
Of course I-

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:42.890
ASTRAL!

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:49.020
If you're going to win...

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:53.980
I'll just throw myself back into your body!

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:00.860
Yuma!

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:09.080
Astral!

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:14.880
- Astral!
 - Stay back!

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:16.630
You mustn't come over!

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:23.050
Astral... You will not save the Astral World...!

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:29.180
I am God...! GOD I AM!

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:31.190
Astral!

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:34.610
Everything...! I'll erase everything!

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:39.280
You! Your friends! Everything!!

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:42.490
<i>This isn't good...! If this continues...</i>

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:44.700
<i>Yuma...</i>

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:07.470
Astral!

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:09.730
Hey, Astral!

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:12.350
Astral...

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:17.190
Yuma... So you're safe...

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:19.610
You idiot! You're too reckless!

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:21.190
Why'd you undo the ZEXAL?!

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:23.910
I didn't want to drag you into this.

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:26.070
Why not? We're friends!

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:29.580
Friends, huh? Yes...

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.620
I did it because you're an irreplaceable friend.

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:35.790
I've been taught so many things by you over and over.

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:37.750
To cherish your friends.

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:41.420
Having the heart to believe in your friends.

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:43.760
We part ways here, Yuma.

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:45.260
Huh?

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:48.970
I entrust the Numbers to you.

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:52.430
Wh-Why?! What do you mean?!

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:54.270
Stop joking around...!

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:56.270
Why are we parting ways?!

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:57.770
I don't want to!

00:20:57.770 --> 00:20:59.400
I can't part with you!

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:02.150
Wait...! Astral!

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:05.530
Astral!

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:11.870
Don't go anywhere!

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:14.120
Hey! Astral!

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:19.250
Thank you.

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:21.550
Astral!!

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:24.670
Astral!

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:46.150
W-We're back where we started...

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:48.660
Th-That's right! Astral!

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:52.740
Kotori...

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:02.920
Astral...

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:09.180
Astral!!

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:23.690
<i>Is it the world that's boring?</i>

00:22:23.690 --> 00:22:26.240
<i>Or maybe you're the one who's not gettin' serious?</i>

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:27.450
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:27.450 --> 00:22:28.860
<i>Do I understand?</i>

00:22:29.070 --> 00:22:31.740
<i>Already got my answers</i>

00:22:31.780 --> 00:22:34.240
<i>Once you start movin', you ain't stoppin'</i>

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:36.790
<i>I go on thinkin' even while losin'.</i>

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:37.870
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:37.870 --> 00:22:38.920
<i>I understand!</i>

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:42.290
<i>Our formula for reversal's already gathered</i>

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:44.630
<i>You afraid it ain't comin' true?</i>

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:47.760
<i>I gotta 'least give it a try</i>

00:22:47.760 --> 00:22:49.970
<i>Ain't no problem if they say I'm borin'</i>

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:52.970
<i>True failure's when we stop movin'</i>

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:54.930
<i>Come on! Ga, ga, ga, guys & dolls</i>

00:22:54.930 --> 00:22:56.310
<i>Go, go, go, go my way</i>

00:22:56.310 --> 00:22:58.180
<i>Oh, oh, oh, over ray</i>

00:22:58.480 --> 00:23:02.480
<i>Door's always open for you</i>

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:07.570
<i>Bring your power forth and go way, go way</i>

00:23:07.570 --> 00:23:08.820
<i>I understand!</i>

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>And tears are no way, no way</i>

00:23:13.330 --> 00:23:18.200
<i>With all my strength, pave way, go way</i>

00:23:18.200 --> 00:23:19.410
<i>I understand!</i>

00:23:19.410 --> 00:23:23.540
<i>Got all the courage here</i>

00:23:23.540 --> 00:23:25.710
<i>You ought to understand!</i>

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:27.920
<i>Go way, go way</i>

00:23:40.770 --> 00:23:42.440
Astral's disappeared...!

00:23:42.440 --> 00:23:43.980
Away from me...!

00:23:44.730 --> 00:23:47.360
He's really...not here anymore...!

00:23:48.400 --> 00:23:49.950
Astral!

00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:53.320
If we try hard enough, I'm sure...!

00:23:53.320 --> 00:23:54.950
If I don't Duel...

00:23:54.950 --> 00:23:56.240
This damn thing...!

00:23:56.240 --> 00:23:58.120
What the hell do you want me to do?!

00:23:58.120 --> 00:24:00.710
Heartland! You're alive?!

00:24:01.330 --> 00:24:03.540
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:06.340
"A Pure-Hearted Duelist! Start Up the OOPArts!!"

00:24:06.340 --> 00:24:08.000
Could it be?! You're...!
